    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρόθῐ</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with all the
				heart, heartily</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always folld. by 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶλλον, ἀπήχθετο κ. μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.300
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολώσατο κ. μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.136
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.284
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλει δέ με κ. μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.370
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίον δέ ἑ κ. μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			.</div>
